# BloodFlow API — quick manual tests from Visual Studio.
# 1) Run the API (https profile).
# 2) Send the login request, copy "token" from the response into @token below.
# ⚠️ Never commit real passwords: keep YOUR_PASSWORD here and type the real one only while testing.

@host = https://localhost:7244
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Login (System Admin)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@bloodflow.local",
  "password": "YOUR_PASSWORD"
}

### Lookups (public)
GET {{host}}/api/lookups/governorates

###
GET {{host}}/api/lookups/organizations?type=Hospital

### Admin: create a hospital
POST {{host}}/api/admin/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Hospital",
  "name": "مستشفى القصر العيني",
  "cityName": "القاهرة",
  "governorateId": 1
}

### Staff self-registration (public) → account is Pending
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register/staff
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Sara Ahmed",
  "email": "sara@example.com",
  "password": "YOUR_PASSWORD",
  "organizationId": 1,
  "jobTitle": "Blood bank nurse"
}

### Admin: approval queue
GET {{host}}/api/admin/staff?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: approve staff user 2
POST {{host}}/api/admin/staff/2/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: reject staff user 2
POST {{host}}/api/admin/staff/2/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Could not confirm employment with the hospital."
}

### Admin: settings
GET {{host}}/api/admin/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: audit trail
GET {{host}}/api/admin/audit-logs?pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Slice 2: inventory (log in as an approved staff member first) ----------

### Stock summary
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Manual intake: 10 units of O+ (bloodGroupId 7); expiry defaults to collection + 35 days
POST {{host}}/api/inventory/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bloodGroupId": 7,
  "quantity": 10,
  "collectionDate": "2026-11-19",
  "clientRequestId": "6f1c2a52-6b0e-4c55-9a43-1f4b3c2d8e01"
}

### Batches expiring within 7 days (FEFO order)
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/batches?expiringWithinDays=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove 2 damaged units from batch 1
POST {{host}}/api/inventory/batches/1/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantityDelta": -2,
  "reasonCode": "Damaged",
  "reason": "Two bags leaked in the fridge.",
  "clientRequestId": "9a0d7c11-2f3e-4b8a-8c6d-5e4f3a2b1c00"
}

### Stock ledger
GET {{host}}/api/inventory/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Slice 3: blood requests ----------
### Scenario: log in as HOSPITAL staff → create; log in as BLOOD BANK staff → board, approve, fulfil;
### back as hospital → receive. Paste each token into @token.

### (Hospital) Create an emergency request: 3 units of O+ needed by tomorrow (UTC)
POST {{host}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestType": "Emergency",
  "bloodGroupId": 7,
  "unitsRequested": 3,
  "neededBy": "2026-11-23T18:00:00Z",
  "patientFullName": "Patient Name Here",
  "clientRequestId": "1b2c3d4e-5f60-4718-8293-a4b5c6d7e8f9"
}

### (Hospital) Requests for my hospital — only the ones that need attention
GET {{host}}/api/requests/hospital?onlyFlagged=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### (Blood bank) The board: emergencies first, with my available units per row
GET {{host}}/api/requests/board
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### (Blood bank) Approve request 1 = reserve all units now (FEFO)
POST {{host}}/api/requests/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Details: status, flags, reservation lines (which batch, how many)
GET {{host}}/api/requests/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### (Blood bank) Fulfil: units leave stock (Deduct)
POST {{host}}/api/requests/1/fulfil
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### (Hospital) Confirm the blood arrived
POST {{host}}/api/requests/1/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Status timeline
GET {{host}}/api/requests/1/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel (pending or approved) — releases reserved units
POST {{host}}/api/requests/2/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Patient transferred to another hospital."
}

### (Admin) Flagged requests: overdue, unconfirmed receipt, emergency escalation
GET {{host}}/api/admin/requests?onlyFlagged=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### (Admin) Emergency overrides waiting for review
GET {{host}}/api/admin/emergency-overrides
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- AI service (start the AI server first; uses the same @token) ----------

GET {{host}}/api/ai/health

###
GET {{host}}/api/ai/forecast
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/ai/shortage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stocks": { "O+": 240, "B-": 3 }
}

###
POST {{host}}/api/ai/expiry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/ai/substitutions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stocks": { "B-": 2 }
}

###
